data: {"id": "d9748a8e04e44843-thinking-parallel_evidence-2252", "run_id": "d9748a8e04e44843", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 事实与结论\n\n### 已证实事实\n1. **Pod 当前状态**：`Pending`，容器 `app` 处于 `Waiting` 状态，Reason = **ImagePullBackOff**。\n2. **根因事件**（来自 `kubectl describe`）：\n   - `Failed to pull image \"registry.invalid/aiops/workload:missing\"`\n   - DNS 解析失败：`lookup registry.invalid on 127.0.0.53:53: no such host`\n   - 镜像 `registry.invalid/aiops/workload:missing` 根本无法被 kubelet 解析，因此无法拉取。\n3. **日志维度**：`kubectl logs` 返回 `container \"app\" is waiting to start: trying and failing to pull image`——容器尚未启动，无任何业务日志可查。\n\n### 关于 `query_pod_logs` ", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1788412395429, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

