alid` 无法解析。如证据表第 1 行（`fact-a138d8525de84`）所示，kubelet 在向 DNS 服务器 `127.0.0.53:53` 查询该域名时返回了 `no such host` 错误，导致镜像拉取失败。由于拉取持续失败，kubelet 进入指数退避（Back-off）机制，最终使 Pod 保持在 `ImagePullBackOff` 状态（证据表第 3、4 行）。该诊断结论由 K8s 状态、事件详情及监控指标直接支撑，证据闭环且充分。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.3m\n├─ 问题定位: 21.6s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 44.0s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-02/workload-65b7f54794-rnlv4: 44.0s (Evidence 34.4s, RCA 9.4s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 11.5s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-02/workload-65b7f54794-rnlv4**: pod-imagepull-failed\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 77.031, "metrics": {"run_id": "d9748a8e04e44843", "mttr": {"value": "1.3m", "seconds": 77.03723978996277, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-imagepull-failed", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-imagepull-failed"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalti